  "description": "ThoughtStream is a contemplative design system built for minimalist personal blogs and newsletters. It embraces generous white space as a design element, letting words breathe and ideas settle. The warm, neutral palette recedes behind content, creating a reading experience that feels like a well-set page in a quiet room. Every decision prioritizes reading flow and typographic clarity over ornament",
